[00:24.92]Welcome to all who gather here this day
[00:31.10]To hear God’s Word and to learn his way.
[00:40.58]Life-giving truth he offers to us all;
[00:48.28]With thankfulness of heart, we respond to his call.
[01:05.42]Thanks to our God for brothers such as these,
[01:12.70]Who welcome us and who seek to please.
[01:21.76]May we keep holding men of that sort dear,
[01:29.60]And now we welcome others who meet with us here.
[01:55.90]God’s invitation reaches all mankind,
[02:02.24]That all sincere ones the truth may find.
[02:11.51]God by his Son has drawn us to His side.
[02:19.18]So welcome one another with hearts opened wide.
